  "description": "The story about young man Min-Hyuk, the famous movie star from South Korea, who will work with miss Seol-hwa, the star from North Korea. He falls in love with her at the extreme speed, but she proposes to start with relationships. Who knows, where those will lead to, but the main question is if the duty is above love or not, as Seol-hwa has the secret order from the North Korean government.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8588055), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/59721692)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nEnglish, French, B.Portuguese, Italian",
